{"id":"strastno","lemma":"страстно","pos":"adv","rank":4713,"glosses":["passionately (in a passionate manner)"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/b/b5/Ru-%D1%81%D1%82%D1%80%D0%B0%D1%81%D1%82%D0%BD%D0%BE.ogg/Ru-%D1%81%D1%82%D1%80%D0%B0%D1%81%D1%82%D0%BD%D0%BE.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Я страстно желаю увидеть вас.","en":"I'm anxious to see you.","words":[{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"to wish, to desire","l":"желать"},{"g":"to see"},{"g":"you","l":"вы"}]},{"text":"Они страстно поцеловались.","en":"They kissed passionately.","words":[{"g":"they"},null,null]},{"text":"Он страстно поцеловал меня.","en":"He kissed me passionately.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},null,{"g":"to kiss","l":"поцеловать"},{"g":"me","l":"я"}]},{"text":"Том страстно поцеловал Мэри.","en":"Tom kissed Mary passionately.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/654079","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},null,{"g":"to kiss","l":"поцеловать"},null]},{"text":"Даже если ты уйдешь, я все равно буду страстно любить тебя.","en":"Even if you go away, I'll still passionately love you.","words":[{"g":"even"},{"g":"if, in case"},{"g":"you"},null,{"g":"I"},{"g":"everyone, everybody"},{"g":"equally"},{"g":"to be","l":"быть"},null,{"g":"to love"},{"g":"you","l":"ты"}]}]}